#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:100
msgid ""
"``hmfs`` Hardware managed flow steering. In HMFS mode, the driver is "
"configuring steering rules directly to the HW using Work Queues with a "
"special new type of WQE (Work Queue Element)."
