msgid ""
"An experimental mode where a single E-Switch is used and all the vports and "
"physical ports on the NIC are connected to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:120
msgid ""
"An example is to send traffic from a VF that is created on PF0 to an uplink "
"that is natively associated with the uplink of PF1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:123
msgid ""
"Note: Future devices, ConnectX-8 and onward, will eventually have this as "
"the default to allow forwarding between all NIC ports in a single E-switch "
"environment and the dual E-switch mode will likely get deprecated."
