#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:216
msgid "``cqe_compress_type``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:219
msgid ""
"Configure which mechanism/algorithm should be used by the NIC that will "
"affect the rate (aggressiveness) of compressed CQEs depending on PCIe bus "
"conditions and other internal NIC factors. This mode affects all queues that "
"enable compression. * ``balanced`` : Merges fewer CQEs, resulting in a "
"moderate compression ratio but maintaining a balance between bandwidth "
"savings and performance * ``aggressive`` : Merges more CQEs into a single "
"entry, achieving a higher compression rate and maximizing performance, "
"particularly under high traffic loads"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:226
msgid "``swp_l4_csum_mode``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:229
msgid ""
"Configure how the L4 checksum is calculated by the device when using "
"Software Parser (SWP) hints for header locations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:232
msgid ""
"``default`` : Use the device's default checksum calculation mode. The driver "
"will discover during init whether or full_csum or l4_only is in use. Setting "
"this value explicitly from userspace is not allowed, but some firmware "
"versions may return this value on param read."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:237
msgid "``full_csum`` : Calculate full checksum including the pseudo-header"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:238
msgid "``l4_only`` : Calculate L4-only checksum, excluding the pseudo-header"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../networking/devlink/mlx5.rst:240
